 531:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/I2c/Std/IfxI2c.h ****  * 					- IfxI2c_BusStatus_idle  	   I2C-bus is free (no start condition detected).
 532:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/I2c/Std/IfxI2c.h ****  * 					- IfxI2c_BusStatus_started     A start condition has been detected on the bus (bus busy).
